en </span></div><div class="con-kit-quark con-kit-quark-paragraph" data-quark="block" data-font-kit-type="l" data-block-key="450rq"><span class="con-kit-quark con-kit-quark-color" style="--color-text:70,143,49;--alpha-text:1;--color-bg:255,4.358400000000002,152.76461052631618;--alpha-bg:1;--color-border:255,4.358400000000002,152.76461052631618;--alpha-border:1">zur <!-- -->freien, <!-- -->gesunden <!-- -->und <!-- -->erfüllten <!-- -->Schöpferin <!-- -->meines <!-- -->eigenen <!-- -->Lebens </span>- im eigenen Rhythmus, in Einklang mit der Quelle des Seins.<br/></div><div class="con-kit-quark con-kit-quark-paragraph" data-quark="block" data-font-kit-type="l" data-block-key="3ioq0"><span data-inline-style="bold" style="font-weight:bold">Meine Expertise:</span> </div><ul class="con-kit-quark con-kit-quark-unordered-list" data-quark="block"><li style="--font-kit-custom-bullet-size:var(--font-kit-bullet-size-predefined)" data-block-key="7qpkj" data-font-kit-type="l"><div class="con-kit-quark con-kit-quark-unordered-list__bullet"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="4" fill="#303036"></circle></svg></div><div class="con-kit-quark con-kit-quark-unordered-list__text"><span data-inline-style="bold" style="font-weight:bold">35+ Jahre Berufserfahrung </span>als Ärztin und Internistin </div></li><li style="--font-kit-custom-bullet-size:var(--font-kit-bullet-size-predefined)" data-block-key="fop0d" data-font-kit-type="l"><div class="con-kit-quark con-kit-quark-unordered-list__bullet"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="4" fill="#303036"></circle></svg></div><div class="con-kit-quark con-kit-quark-unordered-list__text"><span data-inline-style="bold" style="font-weight:bold">4 Zusatzqualifikationen</span> im alternativ medizinischen Bereich</div></li><li style="--font-kit-custom-bullet-size:var(--font-kit-bullet-size-predefined)" data-block-key="2suih" data-font-kit-type="l"><div class="con-kit-quark con-kit-quark-unordered-list__bullet"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="4" fill="#303036"></circle></svg></div><div class="con-kit-quark con-kit-quark-unordered-list__text"><span data-inline-style="bold" style="font-weight:bold">30+ Jahre Seminarleiterin und Ausbilderin</span> für Hömöopathie und GienowMethode</div></li><li style="--font-kit-custom-bullet-size:var(--font-kit-bullet-size-predefined)" data-block-key="9d6ba" data-font-kit-type="l"><div class="con-kit-quark con-kit-quark-unordered-list__bullet"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="4" fill="#303036"></circle></svg></div><div class="con-kit-quark con-kit-quark-unordered-list__text"><span data-inline-style="bold" style="font-weight:bold">5000 Patientinnen und Patienten </span>mit der Gienowmethode erfolgreich geholfen</div></li><li style="--font-kit-custom-bullet-size:var(--font-kit-bullet-size-predefined)" data-block-key="6b0kq" data-font-kit-type="l"><div class="con-kit-quark con-kit-quark-unordered-list__bullet"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="4" fill="#303036"></circle></svg></div><div class="con-kit-quark con-kit-quark-unordered-list__text"><span data-inline-style="bold" style="font-weight:bold">30+ Jahre Zusammenarbeit mit Gienows</span>, den Erfindern der Gienowmethode-Tools</div></li></ul></div></div><div class="con-kit-component-spacer" style="pointer-events:none" aria-hidden="true"><div data-spacer-type="atom" class="con-kit-component-spacer__handler"></div></div></div><div data-atom="line" data-id="SkOrgdSCfdebOfs9j__Fr" data-position="3" data-mode="vertical" data-atom-horizontal="left" data-atom-vertical="bottom" data-atom-pull-down="true" data-atom-zer